	)
	(text "SDIO 4-bit operation (preferred): CLK driven by FPGA, CMD + DAT[3:0] bidirectional with 10k pullups to +3V3.\nSPI compat (fallback): DAT3 = /CS (FPGA -> card), CMD = MOSI (FPGA -> card), DAT0 = MISO (card -> FPGA); DAT1/DAT2 unused but still pulled high.\nCard detect: SW1 tied GND, SW2 pulled to +3V3 via R_CD; FP_SD_CD reads LOW when card is inserted.\n\nTODO: add ESD array (e.g., USBLC6-2SC6) on DAT[3:0]+CMD before fab; consider series resistors on CLK if SI requires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
